@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Search all visible vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/vehicles?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###

### Search by vehicle specifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/vehicles?brand=Toyota&model=Vios&seats=5&transmission=Auto&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###

### Search by price range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/vehicles?minPrice=500000&maxPrice=1500000&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###

### Search within a radius (kilometres)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/vehicles?latitude=10.7769&longitude=106.7009&radiusKm=10&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###
